                    "value": "97% of orders deliver, but 8.1% arrive late. Late orders score 2.57 stars vs 4.29 on-time (a 1.73-star hit). Warehouse-to-carrier handoff (2.81 days) is the main controllable delay, and late rates are flat across value bands.",
